      "source_namespace": "case-human-http-20261111-01",
      "title": "Case/H HTTP 功能验收：人工核查修订与后轮调查",
      "description": "Recorded C02 synthetic materials are copied unchanged into new local identities; earlier A/I judgments and tool receipts are not replayed.\nReal local PostgreSQL, original HTTP routers/dependencies, Case/H services, executor, storage and GET responses are used.\nOnly get_current_user is replaced by an explicit test principal; this is not local login or end-user UI acceptance.\nThe model gateway factory uses the existing SSH transport and real model/tokenizer; local default model credential lookup is not exercised.\nNo vendor or ClickHouse connection is configured. Missing, failed and empty tool results retain their actual meanings.\nTwo Runs belong to one functional H revision chain with the existing per-Run limits; no repeated quality samples or unknown retries.\nHuman text is material-completeness review, not fabricated business authorization. Known model narrative issues remain NOT_PASSED.",
